  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 382(g), an ownership change occurs when 5% shareholders increase their aggregate ownership by more than 50 percentage points during a testing period of generally three years. This triggers the Section 382 annual limitation on pre-change NOL usage.
