  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 732(a)(2), in a current (non-liquidating) partnership distribution, the partner''s basis in distributed property cannot exceed the partner''s outside basis. Because the partner''s outside basis of $50,000 is less than the property''s inside basis of $70,000, the partner takes a $50,000 basis in the property, limited to outside basis.
